</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <b>Black Rose</b> spawns on an invisible material in the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magma Cave\">Magma Cave</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903120926\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 55/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019438/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.267      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   40.267      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3090-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903120926 and revision id 18731. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Magma Cave","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true}],"images":["Black_Rose.png"]}
